    "mgx_02": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<div class=\"mg-wrap mg-sec\">{% render 'mg-faq', list: 'What is the minimum order quantity for corporate gifts?|Just 10 pieces for branded corporate gifts, workable for startups and enterprises alike. Artisanal mementos are available from a single piece.~Can you put our company logo on the gifts?|Yes. Laser engraving, UV print, full-colour print, foil stamping and embossing are available on nearly every product. Send your logo in any format and our designers will prepare it.~Do we approve the design before production?|Always. We send a digital mock-up of the branding, engraving or hamper layout for your written approval before production begins.~How long does an order take?|Standard turnaround is 5 to 7 working days after artwork approval. Delivery adds about 2 days within Bengaluru, about 5 days across Karnataka and up to 2 weeks pan-India. Express options are available for urgent orders.~What is a good budget per corporate gift?|Branded essentials start under ₹500, most welcome kits and hampers sit between ₹1,000 and ₹2,500, and premium leadership or client gifts go above ₹2,500. Share your budget and we will curate within it.~What do festive hampers cost?|Dry fruit jar boxes, sweet trays, chocolate boxes and gift baskets start from ₹1,000, plus branding and GST as applicable.~Do you have Christmas and New Year hampers?|Yes. Our Christmas hampers range covers year-end treats, mugs and goodies for teams, clients and family. Order early for December delivery.~What are joining kits?|Curated welcome kits for new hires: usually a branded bottle, diary, pen and tech accessory in a custom box, assembled to your budget and headcount.~What makes your artisanal mementos different?|They come from Dharohar, our craft brand established in 2012, handmade by 4,000+ artisan families across 25+ states: Moradabad metal craft, Bidri-style inlay, Dhokra, Kagzi pottery, lacquerware and hand-painted art.~Can you make custom acrylic trophies and mementos?|Yes. Our customised range includes laser-cut acrylic trophies and mementos made to your design, with logos, names and dates.~How does payment work?|50% advance to start production, balance before dispatch. We accept UPI, bank transfer and cards, and issue GST invoices. International payments via SWIFT, Wise or PayPal.~Do you provide GST invoices and handle POs?|Yes. We are GST-registered and a GeM registered vendor. B2B invoices, advance receipts and purchase orders are routine for us.~Do you deliver across India and abroad?|Yes. Tracked delivery via BlueDart, DTDC and Delhivery across India, and DHL or FedEx internationally, with bubble-wrapped, double-boxed packing.~Can you deliver to multiple addresses?|Yes. Share an address list and we pack and ship each gift individually, ideal for remote teams.~Can we mix categories in one order?|Absolutely. Many clients pair branded corporate gifts with artisanal mementos for leadership and hampers for the wider team, all on one invoice.~Can I see products before ordering?|Yes. Walk in to our Gandhinagar studio in Bangalore or book a video-call shopping session.~Can you work from our own design or reference?|Yes. Share a reference image and our in-house design team, with 2,500+ bespoke products designed to date, will build a mock-up.', title: 'All questions answered', eyebrow: 'FAQs', hide_more: True %}</div>",
